<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Mpoto Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa ja kutumbula jaka Paulo kwaka Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Timo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa ja kutumbula jaka Paulo kwaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoseo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha kutumbula chaka Timoseo nde baluwa jejalembakiki na Mtumi Paulo kujenda kwaka mbulwa waki Timoseo. Iwezikana chitabu cha kutumbula chaka Timoseo chakalembakiki pachilanda ja chaka cha 62 mbaka 64 baada ja kubhelakeka Yesu Kristo. Chikahi ambachu iwezikana chakaheghali ujomukelu wa matamu ghaka Paulo. Paulo akabhi na ujonganu wa pambipi namaa na Timoseo, na pamaheli andongalela koni akundowa mwana wake (Filimoni 2:22, 1 Timoseo 1:2,18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa ajeji nde jimu ja baluwa nchechi pachilanda ja baluwa nchechi yaka Paulo ambayu ikalembakiki kwa bhandu bheni, wala nga kwa likanisa. Baluwa yengi itatu nde 2 Timoseo, Tito na Filimoni. Chitabu chaka 1 Timoseo kibhi na malaghalakilu ghamaheli namaa kubhokana na ntundu wa kujojabhela wa likanisa (Sula 2:1-15), ihongozi bha likanisa mobhapalaki kubha (Sula 3:1-13), na malakalilu kubhokana na bhabhola bha upuhe (Sula 1:3-11, 4:1-5, 6:2-5). Baluwa jenu jilangi ntundu Paulo moakabheli ambola Timoseo kubha chiongozi pachilanda ja makanisa. Chitabu cha 1 Timoseo chibhi na malaghalakilu ghamaheli namaa ghaghaweza kubhajangati ihongozi bha likanisa kujendesha mambu gha lihengu la kanisa la pandu pabhajemalela.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaghabhihomu</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo atumbu kwa kundamuki Timoseo (Sula 1:1-2).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabhete Paulo andakali Timoseo kubhokana na bhabhola bha upuhe (Sula 1:3-11).</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo ajendale kulanda ntundu moanchenguli Yesu Kristo (Sula 1:12-19).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabhete andandi Timoseo kubhokana na ntundu wa kunjojabhe Chapanga na ihongozi bha likanisa (Sula 2-3).</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo ajomule baluwa jaki kwa kumpeke Timoseo malaghalakilu ghangi gha kujomulela (Sula 4-6).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Nepani Paulo, mtumi waka Yesu Kristo kwa amuli jaka Chapanga Mkengalela witu na Bambo Yesu Kristo, joabhi lihobhalelu litu.<verse eid="1TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Nukulembe wa Timoseo, mwanangu wa chakaka mu uhobhalelu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Nukulobhe chihomu, chiha na lukwali, yeihuma kwaka Chapanga Atati witu na Yesu Kristo Bambo witu.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malakalilu kubhokana na mabholu gha upuhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Ngati monakakulaghalakile panakabhi nyenda ku Makedonia, mbala utama ku Efeso hoku nahuli ubhahibhalya bhandu bhakumu ngabhibhola mabholu gha upuhe. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />Wapwaghila ngabhibhoha chikahi chabhu kwa hadisi ya kuhumbulika na habali ilachu ya akahokolo, ambayu ipelakela bhandu kulochana, wala ngacheichenga lihengu laka Chapanga mu uhobhalelo. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Lengu likolongwa la amuli hajeji nde kuleta upalu, ghouhuma mu mtima unyahi, zamili jambone na uhobhalelu wangakubha na undumila kubheli. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Bhandu bhangi bhahobhiki kuhuma mu mambu aghagha na kung'anambukila malobhi ghangakubha na ndandi. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Bhapala kubha bhabhola bha Shelia, nambu ngachebhaghamanyi mambu ghala ghabhaghalongela wala mambu ghala ghabhaghajomalake kwa uchakaka.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Tumanyi kubha Shelia nde jambone, ngati mundu anaajitumili kwa indela jejipalika. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Bhelabhela tumanyi kubha Shelia ngechejibhi kwa ndandi jaka mundu wambone, nambu jibhi kwa ndandi ja bhabhaheketa Shelila, bhangakutii, bhangakunjojabhe Chapanga na bhabhabhi na mahoku, bhandu bhangakubha na dini na bhangakubha bhahuhu, bhandu bhabhakoma akatati bhabhu na bhabhakoma akamabhu bhabhu na bhabhakoma bhandu, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />na bhakemi, bhalawiti, bhabhajibha bhandu na kubhalombesa kubha ngati bhatumwa, bhapuhe na bhabhalapa kwa upuhe, na lengi lokapi langakujendana na mabholu gha chakaka. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Mabholu aghagha ghapatikana mu Malobhi Manyahi ghaka Chapanga joabhi na ulumbalilu na joapengaleka, ambaghu nepani Paulo mbekiwi nabhatangazya bhandu.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chihomu chaka Chapanga kwaka Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Nunchengu Kristo Yesu Bambo witu, joakanyeghi makili kwa ndandi akamweni kubha nundongwana, na akanhaghwi nuntumakyaje, <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />hata ngati pamwande hapa nakabhili nenuntondola jombi, neng'ahika bhandu bhabhunhobhale Kristo, na nenakabhili nundongale mahakau. Nambu Chapanga amonili chiha kwa ndandi nakatendiki bhenibhela kwa ung'ang'a wangu ghonakabhi nau, na kwa kulepalela kubha na uhobhalelu. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Nambu Bambo witu akanyitalili chihomu chaki chamaheli, akambekihi uhobhalelu na upalu ghoubhi kwa kulombana na Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Lilobhi lendenu nde lakuhobhaleka, kabhete lipalika kujetakalewa nakanopi: Ja kubha Kristo Yesu akahikiki pundema kubhakengalela bhabhabhi na mahoku. Na nepani mi na mahoku kubhapeta bhokapi. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Nambu Chapanga akamoni chiha, nahuli Yesu Kristo alangihaje uhinakilu ukolongwa kwangu nepani nemi na mahoku kupeta bhokapi, ngubhaje ulenganesu kwa bhala bhabhunhobhalyaje palongi na kupata womi wa mileli. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Henu kwaka Nkolongwa wa mileli, jwangakupotela na jwangakubhonikana, Chapanga kanjika jaki pena, utopelu na ulumbalilu ibya kwaki jombi mileli na mileli! Amina.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Timoseo wa mwana wangu mu uhobhalelu, nukupekeha amuli ajeji kubhokana na malobhi gha ulota ghaghakalongaliki pamwandi hapa panani jaku. Ughatumilaje malobhi ghanihagha ngati silaha nahuli uweza kukomana ngondo wichu, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />ukamulaje uhobhalelu waku na zamili jambone, ambaju bhandu bhangi bhajikangili kutali zamili jabhu, na bhela kuyonanga uhobhalelu wabhu. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Pachilanda ja bhanihabha bhabhi Himenayo na Alekizanda, bhanihabha numpekihi Shetani, nahuli bhabholakikaje bhakotuka kuntondo Chapanga.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Malaghalakilu gha kunjojabhe Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Kutumbula kwa mambu ghokapi, mumpwaghila Chapanga mambu ghamughapala, mundobha Chapanga, na mubhalobhila bhandu bhangi, na munchengula Chapanga kwa ndandi ja bhandu bhokapi. <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />Mubhalobhila bhakolongwa na bhandu bhokapi bhabhabhi na lujiniku, nahuli tupata kutama matamu gha kulijeka na gha lukwale, mu uhuhu wokapi na kunjojabhe Chapanga. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Lijambu aleli nde lambone na lunyambiha Chapanga, ambaju nde Mkengalela witu, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />joapala bhandu bhokapi bhakengaliwaje na bhaumanya uchakaka. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Kwa ndandi kubhi na Chapanga jumu, na kubhi na jumu joabhajonganesha bhandu na Chapanga, mundu hoju nde Kristo Yesu, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />joakalibhohiki mweni ngati nyambiku ja kubhakombola bhandu bhokapi. Ukombola hoghu sajenu ubhonikana kwa chikahi chaki. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Kwa ndandi jeniheji nepani nakahaghuliki kubha mtumi na mbola wa bhandu bha mataifa ghangi, na kubhatangazi bhandu ubholu wa uhobhalelu na uchakaka. Nongela chakaka, na wala ngachengolowa!<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Bhela, kila pandu pamuhimangana kunjojabhe Chapanga, mbala akanalomi bhabhahenga ghamboni kwaka Chapanga bhajinula mabhoku ghabhu bhalobhaje, pangakubha na inyela wala kulochana. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Bhelabhela mbala akambomba bhawataje ingobhu ya utopelu, na bhawata wichu, nga kwa kuloka majunju, wala kulipamba kwa zahabu na lulu wala kwa ingobhu ya mbija yamaheli, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />nambu bhabya na matendu ghambone, ngati moibhapalakila akambomba bhabhapwagha kubha bhunjojabhe Chapanga. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Mbomba na alibhola malobhi ghaka Chapanga kwa kutumbala chinunu na kuliheleha. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Nepani ngachenunjetake mbomba kubhola, wala kuntawala mwanalomi, nambu apalika kutama chinunu. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Kwa ndandi Adamu akabhombakiki hoti, na Eva panakatae. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Wala nga Adamu joakakoluwiki, nambu mbomba nde joakakoluwiki na kuheketa Shelia jaka Chapanga. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Hata bhela, mbomba anaakengaliwa kwa kubheleka bhana, ngati anabhajendali kutama mu uhobhalelu na ugholuleku, papamu na mtima wa wambone.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Ihongozi mu likanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Lendenu nde lilobhi la kuhobhaleka: Mundu joapala kubha chiongozi wa likanisa, jonihoju atokule lihengu lambone. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Bhela ngacheimpalika chiongozi wa likanisa kubha mundu jobhundongale bhandu liyaha, nambu apalika abyaje na nhwanu waki jumu, abyaje mundu joatemula mambu ghaki wichu, abyaje joalitawala, joatopaleka, joajopale bhandu, joamanya kubhola, <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />ngaikubha mundu wa kulobhela uwembi, wala joabhi na milomu, nambu abyaje mpole, joapala lukwale, wala ngaikubha mundu wa kupala mbija. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Apalika abyaje mundu joalongo wichu nyumba jaki, joaweza kubhatenda bhana bhaki kubha bhatii kwa utopelu. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Kwa ndandi ngati mundu ngacheamanyi kujilongo nyumba jaki, bho, anaaweza bholi kulighoha likanisa laka Chapanga? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Ngaikubha mundu joanhobhali Kristo henu kateki, ngaahika kulilumbalila na kutemulika ngati Muhakau moakatemulakile. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Kabhete apalika kubha mundu joabhi na luhomu lwambone kwa bhandu bhabhabhi kunja ja likanisa, nahuli ngaihabhuka mu iyoni na chimbenda chaka Muhakau.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhajangatila mu likanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Bhelabhela bhajangatila mu likanisa bhapalika bhabyaje bhandu bhabhabhi na luhomu lwambone, ngabhikubha akandumila kubheli, ngabhikubha bhandu bhabhalobhela uwembi, wala ngabhikubha bhandu bhabhalipati mbija kwa indela ihakau, <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />ibhapalika kukamulakila zamili jinyahi kwa uchakaka wa mkati wa uhobhalelu. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Bhanihabha bhapalika bhalengakikaje hoti, na anabhabhonakini kubha bhapalika, bhela, bhatendaje lihengu la ujangatilu. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Bhelabhela bhahanu bhabhu bhapalika bhabyaje na luhomu lwambone, ngabhikubha bhabhaghamba bhandu, nambu bhabyaje bhandu bhabhatemula mambu ghabhu wichu, na bhalongwana kwa ghokapi. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Mjangatila wa likanisa apalika abyaje na nhwanu waki jumu pena, najombi awezaje kulongo bhana bhaki na nyumba jaki wichu. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Kwa ndandi bhajangatila bhabhahenga lihengu labhu wichu bhabhonikana kubha bhambone palongi jaka Chapanga, na bhaweza kulongalela uhobhalelu wabhu ghoubhi muka Kristo Yesu kwa ukangamalu.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sili ngolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Nukulembela baluwa jenu koni nakahobhalyaje kuhika konihoku henu kateki. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Nambu anangabhakile, mambu ghanakakulembi ghala anaghakujangatya kumanya ntundu moibhapalakila bhandu kujendalela mu Nyumba jaka Chapanga, ambaju nde likanisa laka Chapanga joabhi mwome, nguzu na luhuli lwa chakaka. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Ngachekubhi na choghohi chokapi panani ja uyekuliku wa sili ja uhobhalelu witu ntundu moubheli ukolongwa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">Jombi akabhonakini kwa ubhonikanu waka mundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akamanyakini kubha wambone kwa indela jaka Roho Mhuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akabhonakini na bhatumika bha kunani kwaka Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">Akatangizwi kwa bhandu bha inchi yokapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akahobhaliki pundema pokapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akatolakiki kunani kwaka Chapanga mu ulumbalilu.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Bhabhola bha upuhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Roho Mhuhu apwagha hotuhotu ja kubha machobha gha kujomukela bhandu bhangi anabhauleka uhobhalelu, na kujengalela roho yeikolowa, na mabholu gha majobhi. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Mabholu gha ntundu ghonihoghu ghahuma kwa bhandu akandumila kubheli bhabhapwagha upuhe, ambabhu zamili yabhu ibhi ngati ijochakiki kwa choma cha moto. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Bhandu ngati bhanihabha bhabhola kubha nde mahoku kutoghola, na kubhalaghalaki ngabhikula ilebhi yengi. Nambu Chapanga akaibhombiki ilebhi heyi nahuli ijopaliwaje kwa uchengulu na bhabhabhi na uhobhalelu bhabhajimanyi chakaka heji. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Kwa ndandi kila chindu cheabhombiki Chapanga nde chinyahi, wala njeta cha kukanakiwa, ngati anakijopaliwi kwa uchengulu, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />maghambu kigholuliki kwa Lilobhi laka Chapanga na kwa kundobha Chapanga.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumika wambone waka Kristo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Ngati anaubhapwaghi bhahobhalela bhokapi mabholu ghangani, anaubyaje mtumika wambone waka Kristo Yesu, na wibyaje uyobhalile malobhi gha uhobhalelu, na mabholu manyahi ghala ghaujengalile. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Nambu ukanaje hadisi yangakubha ya dini, na yangakubha na ndandi, nanaghu ulibholaje kutama ngati moapali Chapanga. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Kuhenga mazoezi gha ihungu ya hyegha kubhi na nyonjeka pachokope, nambu kuhenga ghala ghaaghapala Chapanga kupalika kwa kila ntundu, ndandi ghabhi na chilanga cha womi wa sajenu, na womi ghola ghowibya panakatae. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Haleli nde lilobhi la chakaka, na lipalika kuhobhaleka nakanopi, na kabhete lipalika kujetakalewa namaa. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Maghambu tuling'aha na kuhenga lihengu nakanopi, kwa ndandi tunhobhalela Chapanga joabhi mwome, joabhi Mkengalela wa bhandu bhokapi, na nakanopi kwa bhala bhabhahobhalela.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Ubhalaghalakya mambu ghanihagha na kubhabhola mambu ghanihagha. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Ngawijetake mundu jokapi kuujojoha ukombu waku, nambu ubyaje ulenganesu kwa bhabhahobhalela, kwa malobhi ghaku na ntundu moutamila, na mu upalu na uhobhalelu na uhuhu. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Mbaka chikahi panihikaje, ujendalya kukangamala mu kubhasomela Malembu Mahuhu palanga, kubhatangazila na kubhabhola. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Ngawikotoka kutumila nhupu jaka Roho Mhuhu jejibhili mkati jaku, jeupekiwi kwa ulota na pala bhazee pabhakakubheki mabhoku panani jaku na kukulobhela. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Ughaholalya nakanopi mambu ghanihagha ghokapi na ughahengila lihengo, nahuli kujendalela kwaku mu uhobhalelu kubhonikanaje na bhandu bhokapi. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Ulilendaje wamwete, na mabholu ghaku. Ujendalya kuhenga mambu ghanihagha, kwa ndandi kwa kutenda bhenibhela anaulikengalya wamwete, papamu na bhandu bhala bhabhukujowanela.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Lihengu kwa bhahobhalela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Ngaundakalila mwanalomi mzee, nambu ulongila naku ngati atati waku. Ulongila nabhu akakombu ngati bhalongu bhaku, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />akambomba bhazee ulongila nabhu ngati akamabhu bhaku, na ulongila na akakamwali ngati bhalombu bhaku, kwa uhuhu wokapi.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Ubhatopila akambomba bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi na kuhighali panga na mundu wa kubhajangatila. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Nambu anangati mbomba joaweliwi na ndomi abhi na bhana au bhachokolu, bhanihabha bhapalika hoti kulibhola kutenda ghabhapalika kubhajangatila bhalongu bhabhu bhene, na kwa kuhenga bhenibhela bhabhalepa bhazee bhabhu na bhabheleka bhabhu. Kwa ndandi kuhenga bhenibhela kunyambiha Chapanga. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Mbomba jola joaweliwi na ndomi, na kuhighalila kanjika jaki panga kubha na mundu wa kunjangatila, jonihoju abhekiki lihobhalelu laki kwaka Chapanga, na ajendalela kundobha Chapanga ikilu na muhi anjangatyaje. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Nambu mbomba joaweliwi na ndomi joatama kwa utokulelu wa kila ntundu, jonihoju abhi ngati joapotile, hata ngati abhi mwome. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Bhelabhela ubhalaghalakya bhandu mambu ghanihagha, nahuli mundu jokapi ngaabhalongale mahakau. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Nambu anangati mundu jokapi ngacheabhaghoha bhalongu bhaki, na nakanopi bhala bhabhabhi munyumba jaki, mundu jonihoju aukaniki uhobhalelu, kabhete nde muhakau kupeta mundu jwangakuhobhalela.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Mbomba jokapi joaweliwi na ndomi ngawandemba mu ubhalangiku nambu mbaka abyaje ahikiki hyaka sitini, na ambaju akabhili mbomba waka ndomi jumu pela, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />najombi abyaje joakamanyakini kwa matendu ghaki manyahi: Joakabhaleliki bhana bhaki wichu, joakabhajopalile bhaghene panyumba jaki, joakabhagholwili bhandu bhaka Chapanga magholu, joakabhajangatile bhabhabhi na mang'ahiku, na abyaje joakalibhohiki kwa ndandi ja kuhenga matendu ghambone gha kila ntundu.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Nambu akambomba bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi bhabhabhi akakamwale ngaubhabheka mu ubhalangiku ghonihoghu, maghambu utokulelu wabhu wa kihyegha anaubhapaliki kutoghuleka kabhete anakubhatenda bhundeka Kristo, <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />bhela anabhabyaje na mahoku kwa ndandi bhaulekiki uhobhalelu wabhu wa kutumbula. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Bhelabhela akambomba bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi ngati bhanihabha bhalibhola kubha bhakata koni bhakapetaje nyumba kwa nyumba, wala ngachebhakubha bhakata pela, nambu bhelabhela bhalijingiha mu mambu ambaghu nga ghabhu, na kulongela malobhi ghangakubhapalika kulongela. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Bhela mbala akambomba bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi, ambabhu nga bhazee, bhatoghulikaje, bhabhelaka bhana na kuighoha nyumba yabhu, nahuli ngabhumpekeha adui mbekenyu ja kulongela mambu mahakau panani jitu. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Kwa ndandi akambomba bhangi bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi bhajomwi kujileka indela jaka Chapanga na kunjengale Shetani. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Nambu anangati mbomba jokapi joanhobhali Kristo anaabhi na akambomba bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi munyumba jaki, jombi apalika abhajangatya mwene, nahuli likanisa liwezaje kubhajangati bhala ambabhu nde bhabhaweliwi na bhalomi na kuhighali kanjika panga na mundu wa kubhajangatila.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Ihongozi bhabhajemale wichu mu likanisa bhapalika kupekewa utopelu mala pabhele, na nakanopi bhala ambabhu lihengu labhu nde kubhatangazi bhandu na kubhabhola Lilobhi laka Chapanga. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Kwa ndandi Malembu Mahuhu ghapwagha, “Ngaujikonga ng'ombi ndomu pajihenga lihengu la kupumunda mponga.” Bhelabhela ghapwagha, “Muhenga lihengu apalika kupekewa malepu ghaki.” <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Ngawijetakela kujopalela matakilu panani jaka mzee, nambu kwa ulandilu wa bhandu bhabhele au bhatatu. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Bhandu bhala bhabhajendalela kutenda mahoku ubhalakalyaje palongi ja bhandu bhokapi, nahuli na bhandu bhangi bhajoghupaje.<verse eid="1TI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Nukulaghalaki wenga palongi jaka Chapanga na palongi jaka Kristo Yesu, na palongi ja bhatumika bhahaghulika, ughakamula malaghalakilu ghanihagha ghokapi, kabhete ngawitemula kwa manyata, wala ngawitenda lilobhi lokapi kwa kujeghamake upambala ghumo. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Ngawijombateka kumbekela mundu mabhoku, wala ngawishiliki mahoku gha bhandu bhangi. Ulilendaje wamwete na utamaje kwa kunyambiha Chapanga.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Ngawikunywa machi kanjika jaki, nambu ukunywa na divai pachokopi kwa ndandi ja lutumbu lwako, na itamu yeyukupata pamaheli.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Mahoku gha bhandu bhangi ghabhonikana hotuhotu, naghombi ghabhalongulela ku utemulo, nambu mahoku gha bhandu bhangi ghabhajengale kunyuma jabhu. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Bhelabhela, matendu ghambone ghabhonikana hotuhotu, na hata ghala ghangakubhonikana palanga ngacheghaweza kuhiyakika.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Bhatumwa bhokapi bhapalika kubhatii akabambo bhabhu, nahuli bhandu ngabhalitondola lihina laka Chapanga na mabholu ghito. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Bhatumwa ambabhu akabambo bhabhu nde bhandu bhabhunhobhale Kristo, ngabhajojoha maghambu bhabhona bhombi ngati bhalongu, nambu ipalika bhabhatumakyaje wichu nakanopi, kwa ndandi bhombi bhapata nyonjeka kubhokana na lihengu labhu nde bhahobhalela ambabhu nde bhapalakika nabhu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Mabholu gha upuhe na kujoloka hindu kwa chakaka</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Mambu ghanihagha ughabholaje na kughalakalila. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Mundu jokapi anaabholiki mabholu ghangi, wala ngacheaghajetakela malobhi gha womi ghaka Bambo witu Yesu Kristo, na kutama ngati moapali Chapanga, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />jonihoju atenda kulilumbalila, wala ngachealimanyi lilobhi lokapi. Abhi na mangongo gha kuholalela mambu gha malalukilu, mashindanu gha malobhi, ambaghu mu ghanihagha kupita wihu, milomu, matondu, na kubhaholalela bhandu bhangi mahakau, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />na kulochana kwanga na ujomukelu kokupita kwa bhandu bhabhayonangiki malangu ghabhu, bhabhajikosiki chakaka, bhombi bhaholake kuntumaki Chapanga nde indela ja kulipati mbija.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Nambu kuhenga mambu ghala ghaaghapala Chapanga papamu na kujetengane na ntundu momelile nde nyonjeka ngolongwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Kwa ndandi ngachetukahikiki panu pundema na chindu chokapi, kabhete ngachetuweza kubhoka panu pundema na chindu chokapi. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Nambu anatubhili na chilebhi na ingobhu, itupalika kutosheka na hindu yeniheyi. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Nambu bhala bhabhapala kubha na hindu yamaheli bhahabhuka mu malengakeku, na kutangila mu chimbenda cha utokulelu uhakau na wa king'ang'a, na kubhahabhuha bhandu mu kuhobha na kuyonangeka. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Kwa ndandi kupala nakanopi mbija nde utumbulilu wa uhakau wokapi. Bhandu bhangi bhatokulili namaa mbija mbaka bhalekini na uhobhalelu, na kulijocha mitima jabhu kwa mabhinilu ghamaheli kwa ghala ghabhahenga.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo andaghalaki Timoseo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Nambu wehapa, wa mundu waka Chapanga, ughatilaje mambu ghanihagha ghokapi. Ukangamalaje kutama wichu, utamaje ngati moapali Chapanga, ubya na uhobhalelu, upalu, uhinakilu na upole. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Ukomanaje wichu ngondu yela ya uhobhalelu. Ukamulaje womi wa mileli ghowalowakakile na Chapanga pala paukahobhali uhobhalelu waku unyahi palongi ja bhalandilu bhamaheli. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Nukulaghalaki palongi jaka Chapanga joayipeke hindu yokapi womi, na palongi jaka Kristo Yesu joakabhohiki ulandilu na kupwagha mweni uchakaka kwa ndomu waki palongi jaka Pontio Pilato, <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />ukamulaje amuli jenjenu panga na mahakau, wala mahoku, mbaka Lichobha lela la kubhonikana kwaka Bambo witu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Yesu anaapitalya mu chikahi chekibhekakiki na Chapanga, jombi joalumbalike, joabhi kanjika jaki Mtawala, Nkolongwa wa bhakolongwa, na Bambo wa mabambo. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Jombi kanjika jaki nde ngacheapotela, atami mu unang'anu ambau njeta mundu joaweza kuheghalela. Njeta mundu joalabhalile kumbona au joaweza kumbona. Utopelu na uweza ubhi najombi mileli! Amina.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Ubhalaghalakyaje bhandu bhala bhabhabhi na hindu yamaheli bha pundema ghoni sajenu bhakotukaje kulibhona, wala ngabhibheka lihobhalelu labhu mu hindu ambayu nga ya kuhobhaleka, nambu bhabhekaje lihobhalelu labhu muka Chapanga ambaju atupekeha hindu yokapi kwa maheli nahuli tuitumilaje kwa chiheku. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Ubhalaghalakyaje bhatendaje ghambone, bhabyaje na hindu yamaheli kwa kutenda matendu ghambone, bhabyaje na mtima wa kubhoha nakanope, na kushiliki na bhandu bhangi hindu yabhu. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Na kwa kuhenga bhenibhela anabhalibhekilaje chikoku chibyaje luhuli lunyahi kwa chikahi chechihika, nahuli bhapataje womi ghoubhi wa chakaka.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Wenga Timoseo, ughalendaje wichu ghokapi ghala ghaupekiwi, ulijepaje na malobhi gha kindema, na ghangakubha na ndandi jokapi jela, na malochanu ambaghu kwa upuhe ghaghalowakeka kwa upuhe “Umanyi.” <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Kwa ndandi bhandu bhangi bhahobhalili umanyi hoghu na kwa kuhenga bhenibhela bhaulekiki uhobhalelu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Chihomu chaka Chapanga chibyaje na mwehapa mabhokapi. Amina.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>